# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# notes: what is deliberately not linked
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECR-ARC-0001   Only the parser side exists. Its VERIFICATION is the review of
#                 the memory map for P6 against control state, which has not
#                 been done (the map does not exist yet). The gateway tests
#                 test the parser, not the isolation, so they are not linked.
# SECR-ARC-0002   Partial: the gateway half is the G-06 group above. The
#                 integration test with the mode logic is planned.
# SECR-BOOT-0007  Partial: the decision half is linked (D-01, D-03). The "no
#                 partial start" half belongs to the hypervisor, not built.
# SECR-GW-0002    A normal run does not show "never writes outside the
#                 buffer". It needs a run with -fsanitize=address,undefined.
# SECR-MNT-0001   Needs ICD_maintenance.md and partition P7. Not started.
# SECR-DBG-0001   Hardware inspection (HW_PHAC). Not started.
# SECR-LOG-0001   Needs partition P8. Not built.
# SECR-PLAN-0003  To be satisfied by the verification campaign document.
# SECR-PLAN-0004  Needs a repository inspection (a scan for private keys).
#                 Not done. The rule is stated in secure_boot.md, K-1, but a
#                 statement of a rule is not evidence that it holds.
# Proposed IDs    SECR-GW-0003 .. 0007 and SECR-BOOT-0009 are not defined yet,
#                 so nothing is linked to them.